ompress only the model-facing view; never rewrite or discard the underlying trace.\n- Give models compact state, relevant evidence and exceptions by default, with direct drill-down into the raw trace for diagnosis and audit.\n- Never treat absence from results as proof of absence or novelty.\n\nUse `webSearch(query, options)` from `lib/search.js`. Read [references/provider-map.md](references/provider-map.md) when changing routing or diagnosing coverage.\n\nRead [references/evaluation.md](references/evaluation.md) when evaluating search quality or changing routing behavior. Keep the raw trace and derived score separate so a flattering summary cannot alter the evidence.","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false}}
