{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_20261026060150c9fe643279e4442d","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"glm-5.3-flash","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Bash works locally. Write should work (own folder). Now I'll write the two deliverables with full honesty:\n\n1. `nalaz.md` — structured per the 5 task areas; each source: status (PROVERENO RANIJE U BAZI / KANDIDAT–NIJE OTVORENO), URL, what to check, poverenje. Plus a prominent blocker section (permissions lost on restart) and an unfinished-work list (DEM sampling).\n2. `prostorni_izvori.json` — the array with the required fields + `status_provere`.\n\nKeep it genuinely useful: for candidates give exact search/entry URLs and the concrete check to run. Mark poverenje honestly: \"nisko (neprovereno)\" for candidates; \"visoko\" only for what the base itself recorded as opened (Pop-Lazić PDF URL used by vodeni sloj, Starinar DOI, OSM files downloaded locally, Wikidata).\n\nLanguage: Serbian, Latin script. Let me write both files now.","signature":"438ed12c9e1540e780d9cf90"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":0},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"2249e90f-f5b3-4dba-94e3-6ed4eca44330","uuid":"a6a6aced-18da-4f46-bc3b-5be6423c6635","timestamp":"2026-10-25T22:01:55.423Z"}
